// internal/routes/oauth_rig_test.go -- Generated behavioral test for
// the no-infra OAuth2 scope rig. Real RS256 signing against a real (if
// tiny) in-process JWKS server -- see `oauth_stub_test.go`.
// `scope_test.go`'s own no-token/malformed-token cases already cover
// this service; this file covers the scheme-specific cases only
// (`26UpdatePlan.md` M5).
package routes

